    {
      "id": "trail-lost",
      "type": "story",
      "position": {
        "x": 1300,
        "y": 1100
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "The trail goes cold",
        "description": "Last resort. The player has left the Drowned Rat, or been put out of it, without finding out where Hobb works and without going after him when he went: Hobb has gone (to his master in a panic, or to his night's work) and the trail goes cold here; or they did something that ends it (Hobb or the boy hurt, or worse). The night goes on without them knowing where the grain goes, though Kell's own errand may yet find the Heron.",
        "closing": "Close on the river stairs in the dark, the lanterns of the night men going down below, and the player not knowing which of them to follow. Kell writes one line and doesn't read it back.",
        "result": "bad",
        "exitKind": "leave",
        "next": "wharf-night",
        "effects": [
          {
            "op": "remove",
