      "label": "Let him go to work",
      "data": {
        "condition": "The player is done at the Rat: they leave with what Hobb told them (his part in the loft, his master, the Heron), letting him go to his night's work keeping his head down, or the bell has rung and he goes, without having him taken in, whether or not they follow him down to the wharves.",
        "phase": "outcome",
